OL,3,GNEWSACharities 'busier than ever' with
OL,4,Afurniture poverty
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharities say they are "busier than
OL,7,Fever" helping people living in
OL,8,Ffurniture poverty.
OL,10,FBBC South spoke to people and
OL,11,Forganisations affected in Hampshire
OL,12,Fafter national charity End Furniture
OL,13,FPoverty said about six million in the
OL,14,FUK were living without essentials such
OL,15,Fas beds, cookers and fridges.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
