OL,3,GNEWSACharities 'busier than ever' with
OL,4,Afurniture poverty
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnd a group of MPs is calling on the
OL,7,Fgovernment to develop a national
OL,8,Fstrategy to address the problem. They
OL,9,Fsaid they believed that a safe, secure
OL,10,Fand sustainable home should include
OL,11,Faccess to the basic furniture necessary
OL,12,Ffor everyday living.
OL,14,FThe government said it was already
OL,15,Ftaking action to support households.
